  << /ActualText (Head of Creative\nInterlock Marketing Group \267 Full\055Time\nFeb 2025 \205 Aug 2025 \267 7 mos\nRemote\nA parent company that owned a suite of service companies including CRO\054 performance marketing\054 retention marketing\054 social\057content marketing\054 and a 3PL\056 I created new visual identities for each subsidiary brand\054 implemented a creative team\054 and developed a system for the creative team to be able to serve the ongoing needs of the other service companies\056 Additional responsibilities included managing and overseeing the paid ads team\054 the retention marketing team\054 and the CRO team\056)
